A quick wizmode test showed at least 8-9 moves between getting slimed
and death.  A thrown potion of paralysis shouldn't keep you stuck
that long, and magic resistance + reflection should have blocked all
other forms of paralysis.  Are you sure you had MR?

The instadeath spoiler lists the cures for sliming, including some
of the less obvious.  A potion of oil, a spell of cure sickness,
or an amulet of unchanging are all possible cures, but the most
obvious for a rogue who is ready for the quest is self-polymorph.
I recall polymorphing twice, once into something small so my armor
wouldn't break, and once into a fire vortex/fire elemental.
 
